# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxdamage
pkgver=1.1.6
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="X11 damaged region extension library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxfixes)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libXdamage-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('52733c1f5262fca35f64e7d5060c6fcd81a880ba8e1e65c9621cf0727afb5d11')

build() {
    cd libXdamage-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static
    make
}

package() {
    cd libXdamage-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
